<ul id="_7d03fdbd-6040-a6e1-0a01-19918aee25bb"><li><p id="_d29ed5af-d28d-e1e6-cb21-36e09ce98968">Server library (Python):<link target="https://github.com/Domain-Connect/DomainConnectApplyZone"/></p>
</li>
</ul>
</clause>

<clause id="_e8280e7e-f2f1-a263-c4ff-4c57a4559e08" numbered="false" toc="exclude" inline-header="false" obligation="normative">
<title id="_81c108a4-ab2a-f83f-0650-0e153ccd40e9">Proprietary implementations</title>
<ul id="_1846ed1e-991d-42f0-8c76-e8304606b64f"><li><p id="_607eece7-da32-d695-6435-a6b1227c6a1d">~20 providers, incl. GoDaddy, IONOS, Cloudflare, Squarespace Domains (former Google), Wordpress.com or Plesk</p>
</li>
